Revision: 2d5439a4b2129b3bb4ef8fdddf6a60f169973362
Reference: master HEAD resolved 2026-09-14
License: public domain, alternatively MIT (see upstream LICENSE.txt)

The upstream implementation is an oracle and benchmark target only. It is not
linked into the runtime and its internal heap representation is not a public
Project Thessa contract.

Vendored for bench-only FFI (no code copied into the project):
- third_party/libcbt/cbt.h (upstream, unmodified)
- third_party/libcbt/cbt_shim.c (project-owned plain-integer ABI shim)
- crates/rcbt-ffi (safe wrapper; bench/test dependency only, serial build
  without OpenMP so the comparison measures data-structure cost, not threads)
